303 populated entries at scale `10^7`, unused entries `(0, 0, 0)`) and the
401-leaf binary space partition tree (`tightSlackBSP`, with 3 large subtrees
factored out so every `decide +kernel` check stays well below default `maxHeartbeats = 200000`)
covering `[-10^{-7}, 0.012] × [-10^{-7}, 1]`. Every populated entry and every leaf is checked
in the Lean 4 kernel inside `CollatzTwoWindow.TightSlackCert`.
-/

